void-outside-touching.step

Written for springrep by r2rho (Vertec), by a short script of our own that emits the entities of
ISO 10303-42 as their definitions give them; not taken from any other file or program. Two cubes
of 10 mm, the second at x = 10 and sharing a face with the first, written as one BREP_WITH_VOIDS
whose outer shell is the first cube and whose one "void" is the second: the way some exporters
write a compound of touching bodies.

